\\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x),\\qquad\n\\Phi_e^X(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^f(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\{\\langle n,f(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}}(x)\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\setminus2^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"(\\mathcal C_k^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k^A:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^\\sigma\\succeq\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n<|\\eta|\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(n)\\downarrow=\\eta(n)]\n\\quad(e\\in\\omega,\\ \\sigma,\\eta\\in2^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"c_n=(0,t,h)","display":false},{"tex":"y=|\\{j:t(j)=1\\}|","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":3857,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"634b02102672cc2a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deg]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"60962a9176d0987e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。"},{"id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor"